      "position": 2,
      "nearest_heading": "Deriving the Formula for the Volume of a Pyramid",
      "prompt_text": "Use the slicing method to derive the formula $V = \\frac{1}{3} \\pi r^{2} h$ for the volume of a circular cone.",
      "prompt_latex_bits": [
